{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204230","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"narration:0:1320423001:0":{"text":"你们尝试着使用温差探测器，它却没有任何反应","source_cn":"你们尝试着使用温差探测器，它却没有任何反应","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023636E7B3B3220F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320423002:0":{"text":"奇怪，探测器怎么没反应了？不仅没有声音，显示屏也不亮了！","source_cn":"奇怪，探测器怎么没反应了？不仅没有声音，显示屏也不亮了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3DE23FF57A598C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320423003:0":{"text":"嗯？让我瞧瞧。","source_cn":"嗯？让我瞧瞧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCA01CF07EA5B4F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320423004:1":{"text":"……探测器似乎损坏了，背面有被冰锥穿透的痕迹。","source_cn":"……探测器似乎损坏了，背面有被冰锥穿透的痕迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F880F564EFFC6DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320423005:0":{"text":"怎……怎么会这样！","source_cn":"怎……怎么会这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC90E54515129ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320423006:0":{"text":"